ref: apachecon-us-2000

## Sorry!

The deadline for submitting session proposals has passed.  We
are not accepting any more proposals at this time.

---

### Fees and Expenses

The ApacheCon 2000 conference will pay the following
expenses1 for scheduled speakers:

- Round-trip coach-class airfare to the conference venue;
- A one-time $100 fee for miscellaneous expenses (tips, taxi,
*etc.* -- no receipts required);
- $50 *per* day for meals;
- Hotel accommodations at the
conference; and
- All conference registration fees are waived.

Speakers are paid an honorarium of $100 *per* hour of
presentation given.  In addition, they receive $100 *per*
accompanying session handout received by the deadline.  **Handouts
must be in the form of articles or whitepapers that allow a
non-attendee to obtain the same information as those who
actually attend the session; bullet lists and viewgraph slide shots
do not qualify.**  *Here is an
[example](http://golux.com/~coar/slides/Writing_Modules_for_Apache_1.3.pdf), in Adobe Acrobat PDF format.*

1 All amounts are in U.S. dollars.
